<title>ESTONIA: CORPORATE 1996 Q4 PROFITS DOWN VS Q3.</title>
<headline>CORPORATE 1996 Q4 PROFITS DOWN VS Q3.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonian companies' 1996 fourth quarter pre-tax profits fell in a seasonal decrease by 2.7 percent compared to the third quarter, the statistics office said on Monday.</p>
<p>Total profit for the fourth quarter was 473 million kroons, still 3.4 times greater than 1995's Q4 pre-tax results, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>Net turnover in the fourth quarter 1996 was 38.3 million kroons compared to 26.8 million kroons for the fourth quarter in 1995, the office added.</p>
<p>-- David Mardiste, Tallinn newsroom, +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
